    "body": "I think https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-autofocus-attribute should answer your question. Each time an element is inserted into a document, in order, \n\n> When an element with the [autofocus](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-fe-autofocus) attribute specified is [inserted into a document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#insert-an-element-into-a-document), run the following steps:\n\nruns. Eventually during the event loop, when a frame about to be painted, \"flush autofocus candidates\" runs and picks up those candidates and uses them.",
